  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 0.16,
      "end_time": 0.44
    },
    {
      "text": "How's yours?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 0.44,
      "end_time": 1.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, really good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 1.44,
      "end_time": 2.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's get all these kicked off, shall we?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 3.28,
      "end_time": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "First off, I mean, you've guessed already, but I'm not Andrew.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 6.64,
      "end_time": 9.36
    },
    {
      "text": "I think you were expecting a call with him.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 10.32,
      "end_time": 11.84
    },
    {
      "text": "He's got tied up in another meeting, so he's just asked if I could just step in.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 11.84,
      "end_time": 15.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So no worries.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 15.24,
      "end_time": 16.079
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 16.079,
      "end_time": 16.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Hope that's all right.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 16.44,
      "end_time": 17.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 18.08,
      "end_time": 18.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Good weekend.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 18.4,
      "end_time": 18.92
    },
    {
      "text": "You get up too much?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 18.92,
      "end_time": 19.76
    },
    {
      "text": "It was all right.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 20.72,
      "end_time": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 22,
      "end_time": 22.28
    },
    {
      "text": "We got out a bunch.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 22.28,
      "end_time": 23.2
    },
    {
      "text": "A lot of work, but yeah, yeah, good.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 23.44,
      "end_time": 27.02
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 27.1,
      "end_time": 27.46
    },
    {
      "text": "Because I noticed that I had a quick look on your LinkedIn account, so I thought you did a rebrand recently.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 27.46,
      "end_time": 35.34
    },
    {
      "text": "How did that go?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 35.34,
      "end_time": 36.22
    },
    {
      "text": "We did, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 36.38,
      "end_time": 37.38
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, it, it's been good so far.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 37.38,
      "end_time": 39.02
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, it's just kind of moved us into that next place.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 39.9,
      "end_time": 42.38
    },
    {
      "text": "We were a.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 42.539,
      "end_time": 43.42
    },
    {
      "text": "More of a digital agency.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 43.5,
      "end_time": 44.7
    },
    {
      "text": "We've moved into a full service with a couple acquisitions we made over the past two, three years.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 44.7,
      "end_time": 50.54
    },
    {
      "text": "So, you know, I mean, it's been good so far.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 52.4,
      "end_time": 54.64
    },
    {
      "text": "We will tbd.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 54.64,
      "end_time": 55.68
    },
    {
      "text": "We will see.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 55.68,
      "end_time": 56.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well, we, we, we've we've just gone through one as well with one of our companies.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 56.72,
      "end_time": 62.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 62.96,
      "end_time": 63.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 64.24,
      "end_time": 64.72
    },
    {
      "text": "So I feel, I feel your pain, you know, just, just saying, oh, we'll do a rebrand, you know, sounds great on the face of it, but.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 64.8,
      "end_time": 71.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, there's so much, so much to it.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 71.16,
      "end_time": 73.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Anyway, let's, let's hop into this, shall we?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 73.36,
      "end_time": 75.52
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'll try and keep this call as brief as I can.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 75.92,
      "end_time": 78.97
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 79.21,
      "end_time": 79.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Just to give you a little bit of an overview of us and what we do.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 79.61,
      "end_time": 83.77
    },
    {
      "text": "So capitalaire and agencies co.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 83.85,
      "end_time": 85.93
    },
    {
      "text": "We specialize in marketing and media agencies and we either help them to get sold or if they wanted to acquire, we'll help them to acquire.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 86.49,
      "end_time": 95.45
    },
    {
      "text": "That's essentially what, what we do.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 95.61,
      "end_time": 97.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Last year we did just under $100 million worth of deals and transactions, predominantly in the.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 98.17,
      "end_time": 105.53
    },
    {
      "text": "In the States, but some, some over in the.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 105.53,
      "end_time": 108.13
    },
    {
      "text": "In the UK as well, but the States.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 108.13,
      "end_time": 110.07
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, just kind of setting the, setting the scene there a little bit.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 111.11,
      "end_time": 113.55
    },
    {
      "text": "I know like I said, this is this first call, so what be really good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 113.55,
      "end_time": 117.39
    },
    {
      "text": "I've had a look on the website and on LinkedIn.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 117.39,
      "end_time": 119.47
    },
    {
      "text": "I saw what you filled out on the form as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 119.47,
      "end_time": 121.23
    },
    {
      "text": "But just to get a little bit of background from you guys and what you're looking to try and achieve would be.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 121.23,
      "end_time": 125.909
    },
    {
      "text": "Would be great.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 126.07,
      "end_time": 126.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 127.03,
      "end_time": 127.43
    },
    {
      "text": "So I, I started dipping my toe into this, you know, two, three months ago.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 127.51,
      "end_time": 133.83
    },
    {
      "text": "We, for the past three or four years have gotten probably, I don't know, seven to ten inquiries a week for companies either looking to help us get acquired or looking to acquire us.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 134.95,
      "end_time": 146.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 146.53,
      "end_time": 146.93
    },
    {
      "text": "I think this coincided with.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 147.49,
      "end_time": 149.17
    },
    {
      "text": "We made.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 151.01,
      "end_time": 151.65
    },
    {
      "text": "We've been on the Inc.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 151.81,
      "end_time": 152.61
    },
    {
      "text": "5000 list for three years in a row.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 152.61,
      "end_time": 154.13
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll be on again this year for a fourth year.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 154.13,
      "end_time": 156.05
    },
    {
      "text": "So just, I think it was that, that kind of launched people potentially wanting to have conversations with us.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 156.45,
      "end_time": 161.89
    },
    {
      "text": "I have denied them to this point, but I started going down the path and we actually received an offer from a private equity firm two weeks ago.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 162.37,
      "end_time": 172.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 172.76,
      "end_time": 173.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, congrats.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 173.12,
      "end_time": 173.96
    },
    {
      "text": "It's.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 174.76,
      "end_time": 175.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, they screwed up the, on their side.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 175.48,
      "end_time": 178
    },
    {
      "text": "They screwed up the adjusted ebitda and so it kind of pulled the deal off the table when they realized their mistake and I actually.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 178,
      "end_time": 185.72
    },
    {
      "text": "They didn't realize their mistake.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 185.72,
      "end_time": 186.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I pointed out their mistake and we just couldn't get to the finish line on, on loi.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 186.68,
      "end_time": 191.32
    },
    {
      "text": "But it was, I mean it was a good offer.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 191.96,
      "end_time": 194.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean it was, we're right now like $8 million top line where they called us $2.4 million adjusted EBITDA.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 194.28,
      "end_time": 204.1
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it's more like 2.25 million adjusted EBITDA.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 204.1,
      "end_time": 209.18
    },
    {
      "text": "And they had put on the table a 10 million dollar offer which I, which was reasonable.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 210.86,
      "end_time": 216.78
    },
    {
      "text": "Seven and a half million dollars cash, two and a half million dollars rollover equity.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 216.94,
      "end_time": 220.38
    },
    {
      "text": "And they were doing one of these, rolling together a bunch of smaller agencies.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 221.5,
      "end_time": 227.71
    },
    {
      "text": "Right?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 227.71,
      "end_time": 227.95
    },
    {
      "text": "Doing a roll up.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 227.95,
      "end_time": 228.71
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, of course, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 228.71,
      "end_time": 230.03
    },
    {
      "text": "And it's probably something I would have looked at more seriously.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 232.43,
      "end_time": 235.31
    },
    {
      "text": "We also have another conversation with another private equity firm who's doing something similar.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 235.55,
      "end_time": 240.11
    },
    {
      "text": "They've more or less put in the table $5 million of cash and then another $5 million of I guess an earn out over a five year period of time.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 240.43,
      "end_time": 253.88
    },
    {
      "text": "They're working with their banker on that, having some local conversations.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 254.36,
      "end_time": 258.48
    },
    {
      "text": "But I just, I don't know, I mean, I don't know what we should be getting multiple wise.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 258.48,
      "end_time": 264.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 264.4,
      "end_time": 264.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, I think right in 4 and 5 seems reasonable.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 264.56,
      "end_time": 267.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd love to get more than that, but yeah, I don't know.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 268.6,
      "end_time": 272.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So a big one of the big factors for, for multiples, I mean there's a million and one.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 272.68,
      "end_time": 280.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 280.2,
      "end_time": 280.44
    },
    {
      "text": "But you know, one of the more popular ones is strategic fit, which can obviously be something, you know, really important.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 280.44,
      "end_time": 286.52
    },
    {
      "text": "If, if there was a company out there and you just perfectly fit into what it is they already do, they will naturally, you know, be wanting to, to, to pay a higher multiple for that.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 286.52,
      "end_time": 295.4
    },
    {
      "text": "So this, this is, this is part of our job.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 295.56,
      "end_time": 298.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 298.36,
      "end_time": 298.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So what we do is we kind of reach out to potential acquirers and potential buyers.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 298.92,
      "end_time": 305.05
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll have conversations with Them we'll kind of get some back.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 305.29,
      "end_time": 307.65
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean we've already got our own list as well, but we'll do some proactive stuff also.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 307.65,
      "end_time": 310.89
    },
    {
      "text": "And then we essentially just present those to you and we say, you know, we've had five conversations this week.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 312.09,
      "end_time": 316.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Three of them are no goals, but two of them seem really good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 317.61,
      "end_time": 320.85
    },
    {
      "text": "This is how the conversation went, you know, and then you can kind of make some decisions on there and then we can even help you with the, the negotiating as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 320.85,
      "end_time": 328.77
    },
    {
      "text": "Just get those deals done.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 328.77,
      "end_time": 330.09
    },
    {
      "text": "So where you've been doing it at the minute, kind of on your own and to be fair, I mean you've got some offers already, which is great.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 330.09,
      "end_time": 335.14
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, I mean we can, we can help just get that, get that pipeline rolling on it as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 335.14,
      "end_time": 341.06
    },
    {
      "text": "And how does it work from a, from a.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 341.94,
      "end_time": 343.98
    },
    {
      "text": "I just have never worked with, obviously never done an exit before.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 343.98,
      "end_time": 347.179
    },
    {
      "text": "How does it work with you?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 347.179,
      "end_time": 348.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Is, is it, you take a percentage?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 348.22,
      "end_time": 350.14
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there a monthly retainer?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 350.14,
      "end_time": 351.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Like what does that look like?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 351.42,
      "end_time": 352.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, so, so it's a six month process.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 352.74,
      "end_time": 356.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Usually you, the amount of deals that we've done where the deal got done on the anniversary, six months is surprising, but usually six month process.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 357.62,
      "end_time": 366.24
    },
    {
      "text": "In the beginning we'll create some IMs if you've not already done them.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 366.96,
      "end_time": 370.04
    },
    {
      "text": "So we'll create those.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 370.04,
      "end_time": 371.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Then what we'll do is we'll start out our outreach and we'll start reaching out to people.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 372.08,
      "end_time": 375.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course, like I said, we've got our own database as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 375.48,
      "end_time": 377.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Touch base with you once a week.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 377.84,
      "end_time": 379.52
    },
    {
      "text": "And then as time goes on, you know, we clear these offers over time.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 380.4,
      "end_time": 383.68
    },
    {
      "text": "And then usually the six month is kind of the deadline which is, you know, the crunch coming to the crunch and then we just decide on which, which, which route that we want to take.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 383.68,
      "end_time": 391.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So when you say six months, it's six months or six months to close.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 391.84,
      "end_time": 396.14
    },
    {
      "text": "Usually six months to close.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 396.78,
      "end_time": 398.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 398.54,
      "end_time": 399.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 399.5,
      "end_time": 400.62
    },
    {
      "text": "So you know, in, in the grand scheme of things, it's pretty speedy really.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 400.78,
      "end_time": 404.78
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, but it's done, he's done, it's done.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 405.5,
      "end_time": 407.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 407.5,
      "end_time": 407.82
    },
    {
      "text": "So we have a mix of fees really.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 408.3,
      "end_time": 412.06
    },
    {
      "text": "So we have a, a few of 25, 000 that's obviously split up, but then that's netted against our deal fee.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 412.3,
      "end_time": 421.18
    },
    {
      "text": "So our deal fee is 5% if we do get a deal done.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 421.18,
      "end_time": 424.54
    },
    {
      "text": "But then obviously that gets netted that off.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 424.54,
      "end_time": 427
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep, got it.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 427.08,
      "end_time": 428.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's pretend that I have, I'm having all these conversations already.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 431.4,
      "end_time": 434.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 435.4,
      "end_time": 435.8
    },
    {
      "text": "And so you're working for me, I'm working for myself.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 435.8,
      "end_time": 438
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's say one of the deals that I'm already working happens to be the one.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 438,
      "end_time": 442.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 442.92,
      "end_time": 443.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm at that point just paying you the $25,000 and we're going our own way or am I, are we exclusively working together?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 443.56,
      "end_time": 449.48
    },
    {
      "text": "So, so if you manage to get a deal done under your own steam, you know, congratulations.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 450.12,
      "end_time": 454.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, you know, I mean, worth.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 454.88,
      "end_time": 458.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Worth clarifying, but yeah, it's very unethical for us to take 5% off a deal that you've done under your own back, isn't it?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 458.32,
      "end_time": 464.04
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, if you're gonna deal under your own back, then that's, you know, that's, that's, that's all you.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 464.04,
      "end_time": 468.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep, got it.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 468.96,
      "end_time": 470.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 470.96,
      "end_time": 471.36
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 474.16,
      "end_time": 474.68
    },
    {
      "text": "What else should I know?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 474.68,
      "end_time": 475.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 475.76,
      "end_time": 476.32
    },
    {
      "text": "So, so, so just, I know that you've just given me a little bit of an overview there of your financials, but.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 476.32,
      "end_time": 481.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, maybe just a breakdown of it.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 481.2,
      "end_time": 482.88
    },
    {
      "text": "If it would be, would be example how much of that is recurring revenue versus, you know, project based stuff, for example?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 482.88,
      "end_time": 489.98
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 490.38,
      "end_time": 490.86
    },
    {
      "text": "So we have around 400 active clients.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 490.86,
      "end_time": 492.78
    },
    {
      "text": "We have around 130 clients on that are recurring at this moment.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 493.1,
      "end_time": 499.9
    },
    {
      "text": "I think us, like everyone else is, are seeing a pretty drastic drop in recurring revenue and doing much, much better on the one time revenue kind of piece with the way the American economy is.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 502.46,
      "end_time": 513.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, of course, yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 513.81,
      "end_time": 515.17
    },
    {
      "text": "Is going at this moment.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 515.81,
      "end_time": 517.09
    },
    {
      "text": "So we have quite a few dropping off here in the next, you know, 60 to 90 days.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 517.09,
      "end_time": 523.25
    },
    {
      "text": "But we're still, I don't know, let's see where we're at.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 525.17,
      "end_time": 527.81
    },
    {
      "text": "So recurring revenue, we are currently at $291,000 a month in recurring revenue without ad spend.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 527.89,
      "end_time": 535.49
    },
    {
      "text": "With ad spend 393.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 536.13,
      "end_time": 538.81
    },
    {
      "text": "So what, 4.7 million of our 8 is made up of recurring revenue and then the rest is kind of one time.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 538.81,
      "end_time": 549.62
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 551.7,
      "end_time": 552.1
    },
    {
      "text": "And just, just in terms of your kind of market base, I suppose, like are you guys industry agnostic?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 553.78,
      "end_time": 564.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you guys specializing in a particular sector?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 565.26,
      "end_time": 567.26
    },
    {
      "text": "We're industry agnostic.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 567.5,
      "end_time": 568.78
    },
    {
      "text": "We are really all over the place.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 568.78,
      "end_time": 570.1
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a bunch of industries we find ourselves doing more work in than others, but we really are taking on all kinds of stuff.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 570.1,
      "end_time": 576.38
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 576.78,
      "end_time": 578.06
    },
    {
      "text": "So I mean, so where is it that you're at?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 578.7,
      "end_time": 580.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Where is it your head's at right now?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 580.1,
      "end_time": 581.54
    },
    {
      "text": "So I see that say you've already got spots on the table, you're doing your own thing.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 581.54,
      "end_time": 585.42
    },
    {
      "text": "So I mean, is this something that, that you are proactively looking to start with with those or is it something that you kind of just shopping around?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 586.86,
      "end_time": 594.14
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm, I mean I'm talking to actually like three firms today just to kind of see.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 594.62,
      "end_time": 600.66
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, okay, I see.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 600.66,
      "end_time": 601.58
    },
    {
      "text": "Like, I don't, I don't know.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 601.58,
      "end_time": 602.74
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 602.74,
      "end_time": 603.02
    },
    {
      "text": "When this other deal fell through late last week, it was devastating.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 603.02,
      "end_time": 607.9
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'm just kind of almost starting from scratch a little bit again and seeing, you know, I went into that deal thinking I don't know if I want to sell or not.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 610.3,
      "end_time": 619.74
    },
    {
      "text": "And now I'm quite certain I want to sell.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 619.74,
      "end_time": 622.46
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 622.46,
      "end_time": 622.82
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, that helped me kind of get to that place.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 622.9,
      "end_time": 626.02
    },
    {
      "text": "And so now it's.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 626.02,
      "end_time": 626.98
    },
    {
      "text": "What's the best way to kind of get there?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 627.14,
      "end_time": 629.26
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it using a firm like you?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 629.26,
      "end_time": 630.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Is the 5% going to net me more money?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 630.86,
      "end_time": 636.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Should I sit back and kind of.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 636.98,
      "end_time": 638.46
    },
    {
      "text": "It seems like these deals are already coming to me, but maybe they're not going to come at the same value that you all could.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 638.46,
      "end_time": 643.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, so, yeah, so some, some things to factor in with an agency like ours is all of our databases is specialized within marketing and media.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 643.84,
      "end_time": 654.32
    },
    {
      "text": "So even the buyers that we work with, you know, they're proactively looking for exclusively companies like yours.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 654.32,
      "end_time": 659.2
    },
    {
      "text": "And again, you know, we practical go out and doing our own stuff as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 659.6,
      "end_time": 662.88
    },
    {
      "text": "And also this is just typically what we find is if you have somebody that is doing things like the screening calls and there is, you know, an element of third party in, in the mid, you typically can get better valuations on top of that as well, just because it's more of a professional, professional service really.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 663.52,
      "end_time": 682.46
    },
    {
      "text": "But again, you know, there's nothing stopping you from doing your own things.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 683.42,
      "end_time": 686.54
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, we have a, a CRM that we can, that we can help to manage the pipeline.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 688.62,
      "end_time": 694.18
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're kind of not butting, butting heads, I suppose, which could be important.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 694.18,
      "end_time": 697.58
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, if we reach out to ABC Company that you've already had a conversation with, you know, we can cut those conversations off very, very quickly.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 697.66,
      "end_time": 706.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 706.25,
      "end_time": 706.73
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, what I would probably recommend is doing at this point is I know that Andy definitely would like a chat, so it would be great to get that booked in if, if that's all right with you.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 707.93,
      "end_time": 718.49
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 718.65,
      "end_time": 719.13
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, I hope that your other calls go absolutely terribly, of course, and you decide to come work with us.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 719.53,
      "end_time": 725.53
    },
    {
      "text": "But what we do do as well, which is really important is we, we guarantee that you're going to get a buyer.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 726.01,
      "end_time": 730.42
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's one of the real strong, strong things with us.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 731.05,
      "end_time": 733.69
    },
    {
      "text": "There's, there's no way, especially if a company like yours, there's no way you're not going to get, you know, offers on the table.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 733.69,
      "end_time": 740.01
    },
    {
      "text": "So what Would be really great.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 741.53,
      "end_time": 743.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Is.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 743.61,
      "end_time": 743.93
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm just going to put my calendar now.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 743.93,
      "end_time": 745.53
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 745.85,
      "end_time": 746.25
    },
    {
      "text": "How does your diary look for Wednesday?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 749.53,
      "end_time": 755.05
    },
    {
      "text": "Around about the same time.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 755.53,
      "end_time": 756.81
    },
    {
      "text": "I cannot do Wednesday.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 758.67,
      "end_time": 759.55
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm presenting at a conference on Wednesday morning.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 759.63,
      "end_time": 761.95
    },
    {
      "text": "I could do later in the day.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 762.83,
      "end_time": 767.79
    },
    {
      "text": "I.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 767.95,
      "end_time": 768.31
    },
    {
      "text": "All I have left is like, I don't know, 4:35 o' clock.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 768.31,
      "end_time": 772.19
    },
    {
      "text": "If I bumped us.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 776.11,
      "end_time": 777.63
    },
    {
      "text": "Unless you do Friday.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 780.27,
      "end_time": 781.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Friday looks good actually.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 781.39,
      "end_time": 782.35
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's see, Friday's wider open.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 784.15,
      "end_time": 788.07
    },
    {
      "text": "What, what times are available?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 788.87,
      "end_time": 790.47
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, same times today.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 790.87,
      "end_time": 792.47
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you all based in the UK or.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 793.83,
      "end_time": 795.63
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no, I'm.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 795.63,
      "end_time": 796.63
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm in the uk.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 796.63,
      "end_time": 797.27
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm just in the uk.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 797.27,
      "end_time": 798.31
    },
    {
      "text": "We do have some guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 798.629,
      "end_time": 799.51
    },
    {
      "text": "Could he do it any earlier?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 799.99,
      "end_time": 801.19
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 802.47,
      "end_time": 803.11
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm just trying to.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 804.23,
      "end_time": 805.27
    },
    {
      "text": "I trying to have these conversations not in the office.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 805.27,
      "end_time": 807.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Could we do.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 810.03,
      "end_time": 810.91
    },
    {
      "text": "Could we do eight.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 812.83,
      "end_time": 814.51
    },
    {
      "text": "What.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 816.91,
      "end_time": 817.31
    },
    {
      "text": "What time is it where you are now?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 817.39,
      "end_time": 818.75
    },
    {
      "text": "It.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 818.99,
      "end_time": 819.39
    },
    {
      "text": "Right now it is 9:15.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 819.71,
      "end_time": 821.79
    },
    {
      "text": "So an hour earlier than we are right now.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 822.51,
      "end_time": 824.51
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, of course.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 826.19,
      "end_time": 826.91
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's get that booked on the.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 826.91,
      "end_time": 828.91
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm sure I'll put it in your calendar and you'll take it straight back out.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 840.13,
      "end_time": 842.85
    },
    {
      "text": "I will.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 842.93,
      "end_time": 843.57
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's get on this as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 848.61,
      "end_time": 850.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, save.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 867.5,
      "end_time": 870.78
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's get that sent on its way to you now.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 870.94,
      "end_time": 875.02
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 875.34,
      "end_time": 875.74
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we will catch up.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 877.98,
      "end_time": 879.34
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll catch up there.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 879.58,
      "end_time": 880.7
    },
    {
      "text": "But of course, you know, if you've got any, you know, further questions between now and then, then that'd be great.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 881.1,
      "end_time": 885.26
    },
    {
      "text": "As you have these calls with other people as well, you know, please let me know how they go.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 885.9,
      "end_time": 890.44
    },
    {
      "text": "If it's a case they say something and you know, it sounds.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 891,
      "end_time": 893.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Is this a Google Meet on Friday?",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 893.8,
      "end_time": 895.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I prefer Google Meet.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 896.2,
      "end_time": 897.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know if I can do Zoom if you.",
