      "start_time": 897.24,
      "end_time": 898.68
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no, Google Meet's perfect.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 898.76,
      "end_time": 900
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just we did a Zoom today.",
      "speaker_name": "michaelsperling",
      "start_time": 900,
      "end_time": 901.12
    },
    {
      "text": "I just want to make sure I have the right thing.",
