      "start_time": 909.48,
      "end_time": 912.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 913.08,
      "end_time": 913.87
    },
    {
      "text": "No problem.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 913.94,
      "end_time": 914.42
    },
    {
      "text": "So like I say, when you're having conversations with people, if anybody says anything that sounds good or sounds bad or whatever, feel free to cross reference that with us and yeah, we'd love to work with you.",
